  "Question": "A rectangle is enclosed with one side along a wall and a total length of 24 meters for the other three sides. The side perpendicular to the wall has length \\(x\\), and the side parallel to the wall has length \\(24-2x\\). What is \\(x\\) when the area is greatest?",
